# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# wam-research - what must NOT go to GitHub
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical PDFs (89 MB) stay on local/NAS only: owner ruling - PDFs are never
# uploaded to GitHub or to any ChatGPT Library.
papers/pdf/
**/*.pdf
# MinerU intermediates (307 MB: _origin/_layout/_span.pdf + JSON): regenerable,
# never canonical.
papers/quarantine/
# Duplicate staging tree (same content as the corpus root, plus a nested .git).
github_staging/
# Diagnostics and regenerable scaffolding
_diag/
backups/
checkpoints/
repos/
datasets/
papers/supplements/
**/*.part
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
WAM_Corpus_Bootstrap_Pack.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-include: this machine's global gitignore
# (C:\Users\9013804\.gitignore_global line 34 = *.log) silently drops the 11
# MinerU conversion logs, which are Batch 0A ingest evidence. A repo-level
# .gitignore outranks core.excludesFile.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!experiment_logs/*.log
